      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16600\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16600\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e to enter the addition.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThen press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16601\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qnegative.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16601\u0026quot;,189)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16602\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16603\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qminus.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16603\u0026quot;,185)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16604\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qnegative.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16604\u0026quot;,189)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16605\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16606\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16607\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16607\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator gives the answer 8, along with a visual representation as shown.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_2_1_integers_4_10/f-10-4-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u